tps://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23-saur-ops-specialist","name":"Saur Ops Specialist","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9371"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-08-26T06:25:19-07:00","id":1541019,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Carsusbloodking</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/1540678-dragons-of-darkness#post1540678\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">How powerful are the different types of dragons found within the world of darkness? I know there are the zemei, the bygones, and those found within the deep of the dreaming. How do they compare to the main game lines like vampire, werewolf, mage, and changeling?</div> </div> </div> </div>&quot;Bygone&quot; Dragons are split into there types. Lesser, Greater and Celestial.<br /> Lesser Dragons are basically Werewolf in stats but with unique niches and abilities. Like Sphinx type lesser dragons having Intelligence 10 at maturity.<br /> Greater Dragons are your Smaugs and named dragons. Similar to Zemei. They usually have 10+ attributes, numerous abilities and powers.<br /> Celestial Dragons are you plot device stat less dragons. Miles long dragons with Archmage like powers serving Gods.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27335-technoma","name":"Technoma","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"103"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}